    context: "No-login feedback means someone can submit or vote without first creating a full product account. It is especially useful for prospect-facing roadmaps, embedded widgets and products where a user’s attention is already stretched. It does not mean ‘no safeguards’. You can rate-limit actions, use a honeypot field, ask for an optional email for shipping updates and reserve stronger identity checks for sensitive or account-specific conversations.",
